    # table printed by their tests; that no test sets the variable; the ignored
    # tests against the base; seven planted changes to this phase's code, each run
    # against its named test in an archive copy of the phase commit, the test
    # passing unplanted and failing planted, its failure message printed; this
    # script's own stderr counted.
    #
    # Usage: m2p4a-p2-test.sh <phase commit> > <file outside the tree>; the caller
    # moves the output to records/logs/m2p4a-p2/test.log. Every environment input
    # the script reads is printed on a labelled line after its invocation line.
    #
    # CARRIED TO M2 part 4a P2 from M2 part 4a P1's test script (attempt 2,
