    #      in <scripts>, its stderr in <phase>/out, its builds in <build>
    #      (<phase>/test). The base is P1's record commit; the four commits by
    #      their full subjects, beginning "M2 part 4a P2: ". The previous phase's
    #      figures and names are read from records/logs/m2p4a-p1/test.log. The
    #      spec is committed: the working tree's copy and the phase commit's blob
    #      are each compared with the hash planning's message gave (3c4c26c7...),
    #      typed here. The entry guard and the status block allow this phase's
    #      log directory and its records (records/m2p4a-p2- and
    #      records/m2p4a-open-) and nothing else.
    #  AH. specs/0019 P1 verification ruling 7: every environment input this
    #      script reads (RERUN_NOTE, RERUN_FILES, EMEND_KEEP_DIR) is printed on a
    #      labelled line after the invocation line; a rerun line names the
    #      directory its superseded files are kept in (<phase>/superseded).
    #  AI. The workspace run holds the names and the links modules' tests; the
    #      crate runs hold them with the feature on and neither with it off. The
    #      test the feature gates off (part 1's localSheetId test at the write)
    #      was gated at the base too, so the names the run loses are the tests
    #      the source removes or newly gates off, none this phase.
    #  AJ. The template test is the links module's (specs/0019 "P2": the
    #      template part retagged, its container and rels part created): its
    #      printed worksheet's root line is compared whole with the bytes the
    #      design gives, and its created rels part's root line checked to end
    #      with the one external relationship, each with a control.
    #  AK. The plants: P1's six are dropped (their tests are unchanged and were
    #      shown biting in P1's test.log); seven new ones on this phase's code,
    #      each against its named test: L1 the link skip never matching a cell; L2
    #      a dropped link's r:id never recorded; L3 an emptied hyperlinks never
    #      dropped; L4 the root retag skipped; L5 the no-such-link refusal
